message: If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below.
title: GradeWise
type: software
abstract: >-
  GradeWise is an India-wide academic conversion platform that converts CGPA, SGPA, marks and percentage using
  verified, institution-specific formulas for Indian universities, rather than a single generic multiplier.
